      "collapsed": false,
      "body": [
        {
          "kind": "equation",
          "latex": "A_{\\mathrm{pool}}=\\frac{\\sum_i c_i}{\\sum_i n_i},\\quad \\sum_i n_i>0"
        }
      ],
      "note": "c_i为第i类/批次的正确张数，n_i为总张数，单位均为张。总体率必须总分子除以总分母。下列公式使用ODEN原生equation inline，保留可编辑LaTeX；不是截图。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pooled",
      "parent_id": "accuracy",
      "label": "计算：既有总体 Rook 88%，Sable 83%",
      "role": "evidence",
      "support": "inference",
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "source_id": "s-runs",
          "locator": "A1:F5；四条记录，按算法合计"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "s-method",
          "locator": "第5–6、8行"
        }
      ],
      "collapsed": false,
      "body": [
        {
          "kind": "equation",
          "latex": "A_R=\\frac{81+7}{90+10}=88\\%"
        },
        {
          "kind": "equation",
          "latex": "A_S=\\frac{19+64}{20+80}=83\\%"
        }
      ],
      "note": "R=Rook v2，S=Sable v1。Rook是90张透明瓶与10张压扁瓶，Sable是20张透明瓶与80张压扁瓶；两者各100张。类别构成不同，既有总体排序不能直接迁移到各半展览场景。重复引用R-101不能增加分子或分母。"
    },
